# Morrowind Daedric quests: Molag Bal's Menta Na (DA_MolagBal). Molag Bal's statue in Yansirramus speaks his lines,
# hands over Menta Na's key and enables the daedroth in Kora-Dur (10). Menta Na's death logs 20 (mentanaScript); the
# statue gives the Mace of Molag Bal (30).
# PositionCell stands in for the travel, the console kill for the fight. FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's slot 05:
# 053D6651 Molag Bal's statue, 052E655F Menta Na.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_da_sheogorath_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case da_molagbal_start
run
player->PositionCell -70 3100 -698 0 "Yansirramus, Shrine"
wait 120
activate 053D6651
until 300 GetJournalIndex DA_MolagBal == 10
expect player->GetItemCount key_menta_na == 1
end

case da_molagbal_mentana
run
player->PositionCell -4853 -11000 239 0 "Kora-Dur"
until 600 "daedroth_menta_unique"->GetDistance player < 1500
wait 30
console 052E655F.kill
until 300 GetJournalIndex DA_MolagBal == 20
end

case da_molagbal_done
run
player->PositionCell -70 3100 -698 0 "Yansirramus, Shrine"
wait 120
activate 053D6651
until 300 GetJournalIndex DA_MolagBal == 30
expect player->GetItemCount "mace of molag bal_unique" == 1
end
